/*
 * The released jagar kernel DTS includes <jagar/cust.dtsi>, which is normally
 * generated by MediaTek project tooling. The generated content is not present
 * in the public kernel source, and the checked-in jagar.dts already carries the
 * device-specific overlay data needed by this tree. Keep this include available
 * from the device tree so dtbo.img can be built without modifying kernel
 * sources.
 */
